  <data key="d32">paper</data>
  <data key="d33">What agents can do</data>
  <data key="d34">2026</data>
  <data key="d35">METR / Epoch AI</data>
  <data key="d36">https://www.sepolimi.com/p/se-ai-bibliography-what-agents-can-do</data>
  <data key="d37">Agents can replicate substantial multi-file implementation work in a constrained exercise, challenging simplistic duration ceilings.</data>
  <data key="d38">Human-hours counterfactual inferred; not general work-hour substitution or deployment readiness.</data>
  <data key="d39">Make the engineering response an explicit scoped permission, testable gate or human escalation criterion.</data>
  <data key="d40">Observational / qualitative evidence</data>
  <data key="d41">B</data>
  <data key="d42">2026</data>
  <data key="d43">Observational / qualitative evidence</data>
  <data key="d44">Observational / qualitative evidence</data>
  <data key="d45">no</data>
