<node id="O004">
  <data key="d31">Audit your Agent files</data>
  <data key="d32">practitioner_article</data>
  <data key="d54">CURATED_PRACTITIONER_NOT_RESEARCH</data>
  <data key="d33">System knowledge &amp; memory</data>
  <data key="d34">2026</data>
  <data key="d35">Addy Osmani</data>
  <data key="d36">https://addyo.substack.com/p/audit-your-agent-files</data>
  <data key="d126">https://addyo.substack.com/p/audit-your-agent-files</data>
  <data key="d184">https://addyo.substack.com/p/audit-your-agent-files</data>
  <data key="d131">2026-08-27</data>
  <data key="d37">Agent configuration and memory are perishable operational assets that should be periodically revalidated.</data>
  <data key="d38">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d39">Record an owner and expiry policy for agent instructions; Test whether each instruction changes verified behavior; Audit tool privileges and memory freshness independently.</data>
  <data key="d40">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d44">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d43">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d41">A</data>
  <data key="d45">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d51">Instructions in AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, skills and durable memory can become outdated as tools and repositories change. Osmani recommends auditing usefulness, trimming redundant directives, testing outcomes and separating genuinely persistent facts from temporary guidance.</data>
  <data key="d222">Agent configuration and memory are perishable operational assets that should be periodically revalidated.</data>
  <data key="d223">Record an owner and expiry policy for agent instructions; Test whether each instruction changes verified behavior; Audit tool privileges and memory freshness independently.</data>
