  <data key="d234">A practitioner engineering pattern; the article does not establish comparative loop reliability by controlled experiment. Framework or market hypothesis is an authored practitioner proposal, not an empirically validated scale or intervention.</data>
  <data key="d235">Article explicitly names five pieces and a sixth durable-memory requirement.; Recover the specific engineering primitives and preserved-state mechanism in Osmani’s source article.; Provide actionable primitives and their limits rather than an abstract autonomous-loop description.; Do not promote conceptual taxonomy or market hypotheses into established research outcomes.</data>
