  <data key="d234">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence. Any externally quoted benchmark, productivity or vendor telemetry requires independent verification of original method and population.</data>
  <data key="d235">Secondhand empirical or vendor statistics must not be mistaken for independently replicated studies.</data>
