  <data key="d131">2025-11-25</data>
  <data key="d37">AI-generated code should be treated as an untrusted draft and not merged without responsible understanding and verification.</data>
  <data key="d38">Prescriptive practice subsequently qualified by the same author in September 2026.</data>
  <data key="d39">Verify AI output against requirements before acceptance; Record decision ownership; Document the change in the author’s proposed review policy over time.</data>
