  <data key="d45">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d51">This earlier essay stresses reading AI code closely so that humans connect implementation back to intent, testing and maintenance. Its strong line-by-line reading prescription is explicitly revised in the September 2026 "The Code Nobody Reads" essay, which advocates risk-tiered independent checking.</data>
