  <data key="d131">2025-07-01</data>
  <data key="d37">An AI-native engineer integrates assistance into ordinary work while retaining domain expertise and continuous learning.</data>
  <data key="d38">Prospective productivity multipliers are hypothetical and should not be cited as empirical measurements.</data>
  <data key="d39">Teach effective delegation alongside manual competence; Create deliberate skill-updating routines; Do not present advertised 2x–10x multipliers as validated general results.</data>
