  <data key="d45">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d51">Osmani presents a practical skills playbook for pairing with coding assistants, delegating repetitive work and learning better tool use. The article is intentionally aspirational about possible productivity multiples rather than a controlled performance study.</data>
