  <data key="d184">https://addyo.substack.com/p/the-trust-but-verify-pattern-for</data>
  <data key="d131">2025-06-09</data>
  <data key="d37">Verification becomes the bottleneck when generation is cheap; every AI-produced change needs a justified check.</data>
  <data key="d38">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d39">Check against independent requirements and regression oracles; Record the outcome of manual and automated review; Teach why plausible code is not proof of correctness.</data>
  <data key="d40">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d44">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
