  <data key="d37">Effective developer prompts state a bounded problem, relevant context, constraints and the expected verification method.</data>
  <data key="d38">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d39">Provide concrete files and constraints with each request; Make successful output observable; Iterate with feedback instead of claiming prompt wording ensures reliability.</data>
