  <data key="d45">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d51">Through contrasting examples, Osmani demonstrates how explicit role, environment, scope, format and feedback loops can improve coding-assistant usefulness. The book can reuse the patterns as task-envelope teaching devices rather than treat prompt form as a substitute for formal specifications.</data>
