  <data key="d131">2025-05-10</data>
  <data key="d37">Removing junior engineering positions can damage apprenticeship and the future pool of experienced maintainers.</data>
  <data key="d38">A prescriptive career and hiring essay; no original causal analysis of employment trends.</data>
  <data key="d39">Protect supervised learning opportunities for junior developers; Evaluate apprenticeship capacity alongside coding throughput; Compare hiring claims with primary labor-market studies.</data>
  <data key="d40">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
