  <data key="d45">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d51">Osmani argues that early-career roles must evolve toward debugging, system comprehension, collaboration and verification as assistants automate routine output. This is a workforce-development argument, not a causal demonstration that AI has or has not changed entry-level hiring.</data>
