  <data key="d131">2025-04-25</data>
  <data key="d37">Using AI to avoid every difficult step risks eroding the reasoning skills needed to supervise future AI output.</data>
  <data key="d38">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d39">Maintain opportunities for unaided practice; Use delayed comprehension and transfer tests; Keep the analogy separate from evidence of measured developer skill decay.</data>
  <data key="d40">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
  <data key="d44">Practitioner essay / technical guidance (not peer-reviewed)</data>
