  <data key="d41">A</data>
  <data key="d45">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d51">Osmani draws an analogy with other forms of cognitive offloading and recommends intentional debugging, independent implementation, explanation and review. The essay identifies a plausible risk, while the size and persistence of skill loss require empirical evaluation.</data>
  <data key="d222">Using AI to avoid every difficult step risks eroding the reasoning skills needed to supervise future AI output.</data>
  <data key="d223">Maintain opportunities for unaided practice; Use delayed comprehension and transfer tests; Keep the analogy separate from evidence of measured developer skill decay.</data>
