  <data key="d37">Vibe coding can democratize prototypes while amplifying unnoticed security and maintainability risks.</data>
  <data key="d38">Practitioner interpretation; not primary experimental evidence.</data>
  <data key="d39">Separate creative prototyping from production acceptance; Add security and regression checks early; Train users to recognize the limits of superficial functional demos.</data>
