  <data key="d45">article webpage read; linked empirical sources not all independently audited</data>
  <data key="d51">Osmani discusses enthusiastic prompting with minimal code inspection and contrasts its accessibility with risks from incorrect assumptions, latent defects and insufficient operator understanding. The essay calls for professional checks as project consequence increases.</data>
