  <data key="d51">Expanding his 2024 "70% problem" framing, Osmani discusses the durable value of engineers who can interpret behavior, handle edge cases and maintain systems. The percentages are rhetorical heuristics for relative task difficulty, not tested ratios of project completion.</data>
