  <data key="d51">The essay compares v0, Bolt and Lovable for common proof-of-concept workflows, noting different strengths in UI scaffolding and fuller application assembly. It distinguishes product exploration from subsequent testing, maintainability and integration work.</data>
  <data key="d222">AI prototyping services reduce time from concept to demonstrable app but vary in architecture, control and production suitability.</data>
