  <data key="d37">Combines employment-change and job-listing data to describe variation in engineering demand, seniority, geography and company hiring.</data>
  <data key="d222">Combines employment-change and job-listing data to describe variation in engineering demand, seniority, geography and company hiring.</data>
  <data key="d51">Combines employment-change and job-listing data to describe variation in engineering demand, seniority, geography and company hiring.</data>
  <data key="d223">The visible analysis stresses a changed market, but job listings and inferred employment changes measure different populations and do not isolate an AI effect.</data>
  <data key="d262">Visible arguments, author-reported observations and explicitly labeled outlines; no reconstruction of hidden sections.</data>
  <data key="d38">Live Data Technologies and TrueUp use proprietary coverage; TrueUp explicitly concentrates on Big Tech and selected startups. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d39">Hiring and employment indicators contextualize AI-era labor claims without identifying an AI treatment effect.</data>
