  <data key="d223">The visible incidents motivate stronger identity and competency checks; attribution to a coordinated foreign operation remains a hypothesis rather than a demonstrated conclusion.</data>
  <data key="d262">Visible arguments, author-reported observations and explicitly labeled outlines; no reconstruction of hidden sections.</data>
  <data key="d38">Single-company account; suspicion, observed behavior and alleged attacker attribution must remain distinct. Recording or identity-check proposals require separate privacy and legal assessment. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
