  <data key="d51">Developer accounts and maintainer interviews examine internal MCP adoption, debugging, legacy systems and tool-interface design.</data>
  <data key="d223">Internal use can differ from public visibility; expanded tool access also requires security boundaries. The collected accounts are not a representative adoption census.</data>
