  <data key="d51">A Rubrik practitioner account explains shared UI components, ownership and when a design-system investment makes sense, including AI-assisted implementation.</data>
  <data key="d223">Consistent components and design rules require maintained shared knowledge; generating UI code alone does not create a coherent design system.</data>
  <data key="d262">Visible arguments, author-reported observations and explicitly labeled outlines; no reconstruction of hidden sections.</data>
