  <data key="d280">MAPPING_REVISED</data>
  <data key="d281">All eight advertised survey sections and demographics are visible; paid material is an additional report. Adoption and organizational patterns inform observational adoption and team work, not a measured comprehension-debt claim. Avoid treating the author's procurement explanation as an established causal result. The author reports 906 responses for the shared 2026 cohort. This is not an independently counted sample; comparisons with other survey waves are not a matched longitudinal panel. The same page calls the paid supplement 65 pages near the beginning and 35 pages near the end. It also pairs 55% regular agent usage with 507 people; 507/906 is about 56%, so the response denominator or rounding needs clarification. Neither discrepancy is silently corrected.</data>
