  <data key="d51">Interviews with an experienced engineer and a former manager explore ownership, task decomposition, communication and collaboration.</data>
  <data key="d223">The account illustrates effectiveness beyond code activity; the “10x” label is rhetorical rather than a measured multiplier.</data>
