  <data key="d51">An introduced excerpt by Philip Kiely explains serving models through batching, caching, quantization, parallel execution and autoscaling.</data>
  <data key="d223">Inference engineering involves explicit latency, throughput and cost tradeoffs. This is engineering AI infrastructure, not evidence that coding assistants improve developer productivity.</data>
