  <data key="d223">Reported attitudes and usage patterns vary substantially; editorial developer categories are not validated measures of ability.</data>
  <data key="d262">Visible arguments, author-reported observations and explicitly labeled outlines; no reconstruction of hidden sections.</data>
  <data key="d38">Uses the same respondent cohort as AI Tooling 2026 and key trends Part 2; not independent replication. Builders, shippers and coasters are interpretive response groupings, not a validated psychological or competency typology. The author reports 906 responses for the shared 2026 cohort. This is not an independently counted sample; comparisons with other survey waves are not a matched longitudinal panel. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d39">Cost and identity findings extend the shared 2026 survey; editorial respondent categories are not validated competence measures.</data>
