  <data key="d51">Steve Huynh shares experience from technical and behavioral interviews, followed by an excerpt from his book. The account emphasizes communication, demonstrated past work, role expectations and level calibration.</data>
  <data key="d223">Interview readiness includes explaining decisions and collaboration, not just solving coding tasks. Recollections and advice do not establish the predictive validity of an interview rubric.</data>
