  <data key="d51">The second labor-market report combines hiring-platform, workforce and interview-preparation data on specializations, seniority, compensation and management layers. Its preview distinguishes strong AI demand from weaker entry-level and other specialist demand.</data>
  <data key="d223">Vacancies, coaching demand and employment profiles measure different constructs. They do not establish that AI directly caused every change in hiring or compensation.</data>
