  <data key="d51">Accounts from hiring managers and job seekers describe noisy applications, distrust of AI-enhanced credentials and sharply different demand across specialties and regions. This complements, rather than duplicates, the series’ vacancy-data analyses.</data>
  <data key="d223">Reported hiring friction can coexist with hard-to-fill positions. Interview accounts cannot estimate the industry-wide employment effect of AI or eliminate selection bias.</data>
