  <data key="d37">Interviews at Anthropic contrast accelerated migration and implementation with long-running infrastructure projects.</data>
  <data key="d222">Interviews at Anthropic contrast accelerated migration and implementation with long-running infrastructure projects.</data>
  <data key="d51">Interviews at Anthropic contrast accelerated migration and implementation with long-running infrastructure projects. The visible outline preserves planning, testing, small teams and engineering understanding despite changes in how code is produced.</data>
  <data key="d223">Faster implementation does not eliminate coordination or verification. Migration time and token figures are company reports with hypothetical pre-AI comparisons, not matched experimental results.</data>
  <data key="d262">Visible arguments, author-reported observations and explicitly labeled outlines; no reconstruction of hidden sections.</data>
  <data key="d38">Reported migration duration is compared with an estimated engineering counterfactual, not a controlled time-saving experiment. Subscriber-only article remainder not reviewed. No microdata replication, controlled product test, or independent-rater agreement study was performed.</data>
  <data key="d39">The company case retains planning and verification despite accelerated implementation; hypothetical pre-AI comparisons remain unvalidated.</data>
